{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/style/variants","title":"Axes and the visual matrix","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"axes-and-the-visual-matrix","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Axes and the visual matrix"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Level 2. Adopted per component, and it is what turns \"I think that is all the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"states\" into a list."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"a-variant-is-an-axis-not-a-class-name","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A variant is an axis, not a class name"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  bg,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  craftStyles,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  defineStateAxis,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  palette,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  set,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  when,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/style'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// `v` is your own sheet's typed variables, `bp` your own breakpoints — see","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// [Defining a design system](./define.md).","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { bp, v } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'./foundation.style'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tone"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"defineStateAxis","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'tone'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'neutral'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'danger'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"]);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"badge"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftStyles","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'badge'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  root: [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"bg","kind":"function"},{"text":"(v.bg), ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"when","kind":"function"},{"text":"(tone.danger, [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"set","kind":"function"},{"text":"(v.bg, palette.accent.danger)])],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The template sets "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"one static class"}]},{"t":"text","text":" and a "},{"t":"code","text":"data-tone"},{"t":"text","text":" attribute. Nothing"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"concatenates a class at render time, which is what makes the set of states"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"enumerable. The "},{"t":"code","text":"no-raw-class"},{"t":"text","text":" rule enforces it in every file."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Conjunction is nesting, and only nesting:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { fontWeight, scheme, when } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/style'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"when","kind":"function"},{"text":"(scheme.dark, [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"when","kind":"function"},{"text":"(bp.md, [fontWeight.bold])]);","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"One way to write each thing, so two identical components cannot produce two"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"different contracts."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"only-the-points-you-actually-cross","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Only the points you actually cross"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"bp"},{"t":"text","text":" may define "},{"t":"code","text":"sm"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"md"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"lg"},{"t":"text","text":"; a component that cuts at "},{"t":"code","text":"md"},{"t":"text","text":" contributes"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"two"}]},{"t":"text","text":" cells, not four. The contract records what the sheet uses, never what the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"axis offers."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"An interval nothing can satisfy — "},{"t":"code","text":"above(bp.lg)"},{"t":"text","text":" containing "},{"t":"code","text":"below(bp.sm)"},{"t":"text","text":" —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"throws when the sheet is registered, which under the build plugin is a build"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"failure."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"hover-and-every-pseudo-class-after-it","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Hover, and every pseudo-class after it"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"when","kind":"function"},{"text":"(interaction.hover, [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"set","kind":"function"},{"text":"(buttonVars.bg, ui.accent.warningHover)]);","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"interaction.hover"},{"t":"text","text":" emits the same "},{"t":"code","text":"&:hover"},{"t":"text","text":" rule you would write by hand."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"What it adds is that the point enters the class's contract — so the matrix"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"enumerates the hovered state, and the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/style/contrast","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"static contrast check"}]},{"t":"text","text":" crosses the colours it writes with the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"text on top of them. A "},{"t":"code","text":":hover"},{"t":"text","text":" typed into a string emits identical CSS and is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"invisible to both, which is how a button ends up readable at rest and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"unreadable under the pointer. "},{"t":"code","text":"prefer-hover-axis"},{"t":"text","text":" refuses it."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It is a real axis with a real price: it doubles the sheet's matrix, so it has"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"to be in the budget below. Its driver is "},{"t":"code","text":"{ kind: 'selfState', state: 'hover' }"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and "},{"t":"code","text":"applyScenario"},{"t":"text","text":" honours it by asking the page to move a pointer — a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"dispatched "},{"t":"code","text":"mouseover"},{"t":"text","text":" sets no pseudo-class and would capture the base state"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"while looking correct."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-budget","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The budget"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { craftStyles } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/style'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"craftStyles","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'button'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", { root: [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"...","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"] }, { axes: [tone, size, interaction] })","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"An axis outside the budget is a compile error naming it. Without this, an axis"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"added deep in a leaf shows up as a doubled capture bill three levels up and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"nobody decided that. A declared axis that goes unused is reported, not rejected."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-matrix","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The matrix"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { visualMatrix, branch } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/style-testing'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"visualMatrix","kind":"function"},{"text":"(card);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// [{ id: 'base', … }, { id: 'viewport=md', … }]","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It takes "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"sheets"}]},{"t":"text","text":", not a component: a component's classes are only knowable by"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rendering it, and a matrix that silently missed a child's sheet would be the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"worst possible outcome."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Identifiers name only the axes away from "},{"t":"code","text":"base"},{"t":"text","text":", so adding an axis elsewhere in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the app does not invalidate every baseline in the suite."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Two reductions are applied, and both are exactly true rather than probably true:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A branch adds, it does not multiply."}]},{"t":"text","text":" The two sides of an "},{"t":"code","text":"ifNode"},{"t":"text","text":" are"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"never on screen together, so declare it — "},{"t":"code","text":"branch('footer', footerSheet)"},{"t":"text","text":" —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and the absent side stops carrying the footer's axes."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A container axis stops at its owner."}]},{"t":"text","text":" An ancestor cannot change how wide"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"that box is, so only the component naming the container keeps the axis."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Nothing else is reduced. A coverage that claims to be complete without being"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"complete is worse than no coverage."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"a-variant-is-an-axis-not-a-class-name","text":"A variant is an axis, not a class name"},{"level":2,"id":"only-the-points-you-actually-cross","text":"Only the points you actually cross"},{"level":2,"id":"hover-and-every-pseudo-class-after-it","text":"Hover, and every pseudo-class after it"},{"level":2,"id":"the-budget","text":"The budget"},{"level":2,"id":"the-matrix","text":"The matrix"}]}